b6:b5:oveq2d  |- ( ph -> ( A + ( ( ( B - A ) / ( * ` ( B - A ) ) ) x. ( * ` ( ( B + ( ( ( A - B ) / ( * ` ( A - B ) ) ) x. ( * ` ( R - B ) ) ) ) - A ) ) ) ) = ( A + ( ( ( B - A ) / ( * ` ( B - A ) ) ) x. ( * ` ( ( A + ( ( ( B - A ) / ( * ` ( B - A ) ) ) x. ( * ` ( R - A ) ) ) ) - A ) ) ) ) )
b7:b6,b2:eqtrd  |- ( ph -> ( A + ( ( ( B - A ) / ( * ` ( B - A ) ) ) x. ( * ` ( ( B + ( ( ( A - B ) / ( * ` ( A - B ) ) ) x. ( * ` ( R - B ) ) ) ) - A ) ) ) ) = R )

$( PART C: the outer rotation about A by 2 X , as two reflections $)
c1:2,4,6,dV1:cnrflfix  |- ( ph -> ( ( A + ( ( ( R - A ) / ( * ` ( R - A ) ) ) x. ( * ` ( A - A ) ) ) ) = A /\ ( A + ( ( ( R - A ) / ( * ` ( R - A ) ) ) x. ( * ` ( R - A ) ) ) ) = R ) )
