c6:c5:oveq2d  |- ( ph -> ( ( ( R - A ) / ( * ` ( R - A ) ) ) x. ( * ` ( ( A + ( ( ( B - A ) / ( * ` ( B - A ) ) ) x. ( * ` ( ( B + ( ( ( A - B ) / ( * ` ( A - B ) ) ) x. ( * ` ( R - B ) ) ) ) - A ) ) ) ) - A ) ) ) = ( ( ( R - A ) / ( * ` ( R - A ) ) ) x. ( * ` ( R - A ) ) ) )
