c9:c3:eqcomd  |- ( ph -> ( A + ( ( exp ` ( _i x. ( 2 x. ( ( B - A ) F ( R - A ) ) ) ) ) x. ( ( B + ( ( ( A - B ) / ( * ` ( A - B ) ) ) x. ( * ` ( R - B ) ) ) ) - A ) ) ) = ( A + ( ( ( R - A ) / ( * ` ( R - A ) ) ) x. ( * ` ( ( A + ( ( ( B - A ) / ( * ` ( B - A ) ) ) x. ( * ` ( ( B + ( ( ( A - B ) / ( * ` ( A - B ) ) ) x. ( * ` ( R - B ) ) ) ) - A ) ) ) ) - A ) ) ) ) )
